1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,500
A massive gas giant hangs in the starry blackness. Its swirling atmosphere is banded in broad strokes of teal, maroon, and pearlescent white. A small grey moon orbits to the left.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,500
A colony ship streaks toward the planet from the lower left, riding a bright trail of light.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,205
The tiny craft descends toward the turbulent clouds, plunging into the vast, gaseous expanse.
